# Keep MCP public but the Blossom administrator private

- blossom.wenneker.dev is the PUBLIC MCP/OAuth gateway, not a public Studio admin application.
- Studio admin stays at http://127.0.0.1:8787/ unless the user explicitly authorizes a separately protected deployment.
- Cloudflare Tunnel on the hosting Mac points at http://127.0.0.1:8787 and preserves the public Host header.
- Public allowlist: minimal homepage/health, OAuth discovery/register/authorize/token and authenticated /mcp. Public /login, /api/*, Studio JS/admin/secrets must stay blocked.
- Diagnose local server, Host routing, DNS/HTTPS, tunnel process, OAuth discovery 200, unauthenticated MCP 401 challenge, token exchange and tools/list separately.
- Do not blindly disable WAF, expose admin via 0.0.0.0, recreate tunnel credentials or assert the public host is broken because ChatGPT displays Connecting.
- An HTTP 200 discovery + HTTP 401 unauthenticated MCP challenge only proves routing and auth policy, not a completed connector.
